max on OpenCode Go or LLM Gateway. Luna xhigh fast only on the Codex CLI, dropped when its quota is spent. Fable 5.2 medium for synthesis and key reviews. |\n52: | D5 | Live behaviour runs happen only in an arena: a throwaway clone, no remote, credentials off. |\n53: | D6 | Holdout prompt text is never read. Every number comes from a committed script. |\n54: \n55: <!-- /ANCHOR:directive -->\n56: \n57: ---\n58: \n59: <!-- ANCHOR:binding -->\n60: ## 2. BINDING\n61: <!-- FILL: List each child phase and its goal path. Name the precedence rule. GOOD: 001 and 002. Decisions here outrank child detail. WEAK: Children are bound. -->\n62: \n63: **Read the child goal before working a phase.** Each is authoritative for its\n64: phase and binds as if written here.\n65: \n66: | Phase | Goal document |\n67: |-------|---------------|\n68: | 001-command-routing-baseline-corpus | `001-command-routing-baseline-corpus/goal.md` |\n69: | 002-command-inventory-and-risk-metadata | `002-command-inventory-and-risk-metadata/goal.md` |\n70: | 003-plain-chat-command-reach | `003-plain-chat-command-reach/goal.md` |\n71: | 004-command-meaning-matching | `004-command-meaning-matching/goal.md` |\n72: | 005-recommendation-contract-and-brief | `005-recommendation-contract-and-brief/goal.md` |\n73: | 006-gate-2-binding-and-runtime-pointers | `006-gate-2-binding-and-runtime-pointers/goal.md` |\n74: | 007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof | `007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/goal.md` |\n75: | 008-embedder-setup-and-cost | `008-embedder-setup-and-cost/goal.md` |\n76: \n77: **Precedence.** Decisions above outrank child detail. Child detail outranks any\n78: summary of it. Name a conflict rather than resolving it silently.\n79: \n80: **Stop.** Only the criteria below decide done. An evaluator sees the objective\n81: string, not these files.\n82: <!-- /ANCHOR:binding -->\n83: \n84: ---\n85: \n86: <!-- ANCHOR:completion -->\n87: ## 3. COMPLETION CRITERIA\n88: <!-- FILL: Write one command-checkable criterion per line