{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794523774067,"sessionID":"ses_e2e0e4b2cffeAWQl6ZGxUDL6xW","part":{"partID":"prt_1d1f3b9d9001W5uf9biF0bW54k","sessionID":"ses_e2e0e4b2cffeAWQl6ZGxUDL6xW","messageID":"msg_1d1f3b10f001PsMEzwSDs63TrO","type":"tool","id":"call_849260d910664488940652a6","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"for f in specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/00{5,6,7,8}-*/tasks.md; do echo \"== $f\"; sed -n '63,160p' \"$f\" | rg -n 'T[0-9]{3}' | head -70; done"},"output":"92:- [ ] T047 Run `npm run build` in `ADV` and in `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime`. Verify: `$REC '{\"prompt\":\"save context\"}' | jq '[.data.recommendations[] | select(.command == \"/speckit:save\")] | length'` prints 1, and `$REC '{\"prompt\":\"/speckit:plan add a login page\"}' | jq -c '.data.recommendations[0] | {kind,command,policy,ownerSkillId}'` prints `{\"kind\":\"command\",\"command\":\"/speckit:plan\",\"policy\":\"start\",\"ownerSkillId\":\"system-spec-kit\"}`.\n93:- [ ] T048 Run `node $S/brief-heads.mjs > $S/brief-heads-after.txt`. Verify: the first line reads `Advisor: live; use system-spec-kit → /speckit:plan (start) 0.82/0.16 pass.`, the git hooks line contains `/doctor:git hooks (ask)`, and `rg -c \"command-\" $S/brief-heads-after.txt` prints nothing.\n94:- [ ] T049 With Ollama up, run `node $RC --hub sk-doc > $S/reach-after.txt`. Verify: it exits 0 and prints `outranked=0` and `RESULT: PASSED`.\n95:- [ ] T050 Run `$S/hook-latency.mjs` three times (`$S/hook-latency-after-{1,2,3}.json`). Verify: the middle median is at most 25 ms over the T003 middle median and the middle p95 at most 40 ms over the T003 middle p95.\n96:- [ ] T051 Run every gate. Verify: `node $D --check | jq -r .status` prints `fresh`, `$ROLL` prints `{\"ask\":17,\"run\":7,\"start\":20}`, `$P` prints `[159,50,20,5]`, `$TC` exits 0, `python3 $ADV/tests/python/test_skill_advisor.py` exits 0, `node $RT` exits 0, `node .skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk