prompt_embedding_unreachable\"]` for that reason and `[]` for null (`$ADV/tests/semantic-prompt-embedding-degrade.vitest.ts`). Verify: in `$ADV` `npx vitest run tests/semantic-prompt-embedding-degrade.vitest.ts` reports 7 passed.\n19:- [ ] T028 Add embedder cases to the route contract test: the route is in the manifest, its YAML stops at an approval before any `ollama pull`, `ollama serve` or `skill_graph_scan`, `--dry-run` stops after the plan and no step installs Ollama (`DOC/scripts/tests/skill-advisor-route-contract.test.cjs`). Verify: `node DOC/scripts/tests/skill-advisor-route-contract.test.cjs` exits 0.\n20:- [ ] T029 Update the install contract test so it expects six steps with `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` as step 5 and `/doctor:setup` as step 6 (`DOC/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs`). Verify: `node DOC/scripts/tests/doctor-install-contract.test.cjs` exits 0.\n21:- [ ] T030 Add one entry for `measure-embedder-cost.mjs`: what it reads, that it writes and unloads nothing, its exit 2 and how to take a cold sample (`$ADV/scripts/README.md`). Verify: `rg -n \"measure-embedder-cost\" $ADV/scripts/README.md` prints at least one line.\n22:- [ ] T031 Build and rescan so the daemon serves the new code and the route's bridge has a vector. Run `npm --prefix $ADV run build`, then `X skill_graph_scan --trusted --format json`. Verify: the scan exits 0 and `sqlite3 -readonly $ADV/database/skill-graph.sqlite 'select count(*) from vec_cmd_768'` prints the same number as `jq '[.entries[] | select(.embeddingText != null)] | length' $ADV/scripts/command-bridges/command-bridges.generated.json`.\n23:- [ ] T032 Run `E` with the model loaded (`$S/cost-warm.json`). Verify: `node $E > $S/cost-warm.json` exits 0 and `jq -c '[.model.sizeBytes, .memory.serveRssKb, .memory.runnerRssKb, .warm.medianMs, .warm.p95Ms, .cli.medianMs]' $S/cost-warm.json` prints six numbers.\n24:- [ ] T033 Run `E` again after the model unloaded on its own (`$S/cost-cold.json`). Wait until `cur