` and `warm.p95Ms`. When `/api/ps` listed no model before the first call, record that first call as `cold.firstCallMs` and the `ollama serve` resident memory as `idle.serveRssKb`. Otherwise print `cold: null` with the reason `model already loaded` (`E`). Verify: `node $E | jq -c '.warm, .cold'` prints `n` 30, a median, a p95 and either `null` or a number.\n3:- [ ] T012 In the `catch` of `withSemanticShadowPromptEmbedding`, set `disabledReason` from the error that `adapter.embed` or the deadline raised: `prompt_embedding_model_missing` for `OllamaModelNotLoadedError`, `prompt_embedding_timeout` for `PromptEmbeddingTimeoutError` or `OllamaRequestTimeoutError`, `prompt_embedding_unreachable` for any other `OllamaBackendUnreachableError` and `prompt_embedding_failed` otherwise. Leave the reasons set before the embed (`database_absent`, `adapter_unavailable`, `dim_mismatch`) as they are (`$ADV/lib/scorer/lanes/semantic-shadow.ts`). Verify: `rg -n \"prompt_embedding_(model_missing|timeout|unreachable)\" $ADV/lib/scorer/lanes/semantic-shadow.ts` prints three lines and in `$ADV` `npx vitest run tests/scorer` reports 0 failed.\n4:- [ ] T013 In `readSemanticLaneHealth`, add `commandVectorCoverage`: `embedded` counts rows of `commandVecTableNameForDim(activeDim)` when that table exists and 0 otherwise, and `total` is `readCommandEmbeddingSources()?.length ?? 0` (`$ADV/handlers/advisor-status.ts`). Verify: `npm --prefix $ADV run typecheck` exits 0 and in `$ADV` `npx vitest run tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts` reports 0 failed. The live value is checked in T042.\n5:- [ ] T014 Add the route to the manifest after `router-reach`: `command: /doctor:skill-advisor`, `target: embedder`, `yaml: doctor-skill-advisor-embedder.yaml`, `setup_vars: [execution_mode, dry_run]`, `allowed_flags: [\"--dry-run\"]`, `mutating: mutates`, a `gate3_location` naming the advisor database and the user's Ollama model store, the `cli_commands` T009 runs and three or more `trigger_phrases` of three or more words, such as \"set up meaning matching\", \"install the local embedder\" and \"ollama is not running for the advisor\" (`DOC/_routes.yaml`). Verify: `bash DOC/scripts/route-validate.sh` exits 0.\n6:- [ ] T015 Add the embedder blocks to the presentation contract: the probe dashboard, the plan table with columns step, cost and undo, the approval prompt, the dry-run result and the final result (`DOC/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt`). Verify: `rg -n -i \"embedder\" DOC/assets/doctor-skill-advisor-presentation.txt` prints at least five lines.\n7:- [x] T016 Add the CLI section to `E`: five `X advisor_recommend` calls with distinct prompts timed end to end, printed as `cli.ms` (all five) and `cli.medianMs` (`E`). Verify: `node $E | jq -c '.cli'` prints five numbers and a median, and `git status --short` shows no change made by the run.\n8:- [ ] T017 In `handleAdvisorStatus`, when `includeSemanticHealth` is set and the active manifest's backend is `ollama`, await `probeOllamaModel(resolveOllamaBaseUrl(), <manifest ollamaName>, 500)` and merge `backend` into `semanticLaneHealth`: `reachable` when available, `model_missing` when the reason says the model is not loaded and `unreachable` otherwise. Set `laneEnabled` to false unless `reachable`. A non-Ollama backend gets `probe_not_implemented`. Keep `readAdvisorStatus` synchronous (`$ADV/handlers/advisor-status.ts`). Verify: `npm --prefix $ADV run typecheck` exits 0 and in `$ADV` `npx vitest run tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts` reports 0 failed. The live value is checked in T042.\n9:- [ ] T018 Add the `embedder` row to the execution target table and to the `argument-hint` line (`DOC/skill-advisor.md`). Verify: `rg -n \"embedder\" DOC/skill-advisor.md` prints at least two lines.\n10:- [ ] T019 Create the degrade test with the adapter, the active pointer and the read-only database mocked, and `VITEST` stubbed to `false` inside each case. Six rows: warm answer scored with a cosine, cold answer at 300