{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794523876876,"sessionID":"ses_e2e0e4b2cffeAWQl6ZGxUDL6xW","part":{"partID":"prt_1d1f54e0200132dYiip1D1p1Hv","sessionID":"ses_e2e0e4b2cffeAWQl6ZGxUDL6xW","messageID":"msg_1d1f543ba001W5sdvj6qbSk9ve","type":"tool","id":"call_e7fd9c9807064bec8169bf6e","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"limit":50,"offset":33,"path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/decision-record.md"},"output":"Read file specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/decision-record.md, lines 33-82\n33: ## Operator Decisions\n34: \n35: | ID | Decided | Why | Supersedes | Carried by |\n36: |----|---------|-----|------------|------------|\n37: | Q001 | Update the codex, pi and opencode CLIs globally before the research run. | Not stated. | None | 007-command-surfacing-and-workflow-enforcement research setup |\n38: | Q002 | Repair the Pi extension loading broken by the pi 1.5.2 update instead of working around it. | Not stated. | None | 007 research setup, cli-pi envelope |\n39: | Q003 | Run 30 deep-research iterations in total, 10 per executor. | Not stated. | None | 007 research/research.md |\n40: | Q004 | Treat the uncommitted pi edits in the main checkout as possibly from another session and keep them. | Not stated. | None | 007 research setup |\n41: | Q005 | Run the Fable reviewer through the Claude Code CLI after the subagent hook refused it. | Not stated. | None | 007 research/synthesis-review.md |\n42: | Q006 | D1: a surfaced command that writes tracked files the user asked for is started, not asked about. | Not stated. | None | 007 research.md section 13, 002 commandPolicies |\n43: | Q007 | D2: a hub mode with a command offers that command while the skill keeps flexibility. | Not stated. | None | 007 research.md section 13, 003 lib/command-attach.ts |\n44: | Q008 | D3: a deep loop is offered only when the prompt uses depth wording. | Not stated. | None | 007 research.md section