n-record.md ADR-016, AC-007 |\n57: | Q021 | Plan and build phases 005 to 007 in turn, with DeepSeek workers through Pi. | Not stated. | None | 005, 006 and 007 plan.md and tasks.md, commits 80b79880f1, 59e38411ad and the phase 006 plan commit |\n58: | Q022 | No choice made about the Ollama server. The operator asked when an embedding model came into use. | Not stated. | None | Answered in the next dialog. The server stays up until the build ends. |\n59: | Q023 | Settle the eight other unmet criteria of phase 003: three move to phase 005, three doctor rows are superseded by phase 004, the capture-order miss is waived and the widened phrase gate is accepted. | Not stated. | None | 003-plain-chat-command-reach decision-record.md ADR-017 to ADR-020, 005 CARRY-003 group, commit fe20ca1c36 |\n60: | Q024 | Harden the install and setup experience for external repository users around the embedder dependency, and measure its memory and performance cost. | The operator sees a running local server as a real dependency for people who install Skilled into their own repository. | None | 008-embedder-setup-and-cost spec.md, plan.md and tasks.md |\n61: | Q025 | Rename the four old spec-kit command ids and drop the dead Python prompt row. Leave the deep-loop and create ids as a recorded limitation. | Not stated. | None | 005-recommendation-contract-and-brief spec.md section 10, wave 6 tasks |\n62: | Q026 | A degraded brief shows a command only when the prompt typed it. | Not stated. | None | 005-recommendation-contract-and-brief spec.md section 10, G6 requirement |\n63: | Q027 | A bare /doctor:update row prints the strictest policy of its actions, ask. | Not stated. | None | 005-recommendation-contract-and-brief spec.md section 10 |\n64: | Q028 | The Gate 2 bullet offers the command beside the skill, in the 463-byte text the operator saw. | Not stated. | None | 006-gate-2-binding-and-runtime-pointers tasks.md T003, scratch/bullet-draft.txt |\n65: | Q029 | A dispatched child sees a su