{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794525309966,"sessionID":"ses_e2e0e4b2cffeAWQl6ZGxUDL6xW","part":{"partID":"prt_1d20b1d2e001zccf6eH5yKwFbo","sessionID":"ses_e2e0e4b2cffeAWQl6ZGxUDL6xW","messageID":"msg_1d20af09e001F69iBLpwjSdCGc","type":"tool","id":"call_af7c6d2dbc1e41beafbacd10","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"- **KQ3 — which discovery defects exist: answered.** One confirmed collision costs 12 commands on Claude (`32/44`), the same file is mirrored into OpenCode untested, the same command has three native spellings, and Devin has no command surface at all. No check measures any of it. (The strategy box stays unticked because the iteration record's text dropped the backticks around `skill.md`; the answer is in `iterations/iteration-003.md`.)","oldString":"- **KQ3 — which discovery defects exist: answered.** One confirmed collision costs 12 commands on Claude (`32/44`), the same file is mirrored into OpenCode untested, the same command has three native spellings, and Devin has no command surface at all. No check measures any of it.","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/research.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/research.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/research.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/research.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/research.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/research.md\n@@ -15,9 +15,9 @@\n ## 2. Answers to key questions\n \n - **KQ1 — what the brief emits and whether a model can act on it: half answered.** The payload is measured (242 to 298 bytes, 60 to 75 tokens, three lines, a 320-byte head cap with at most 96 bytes used). It carries no document path and no offer state. Whether a model *acts* on the planned head needs the post arm.\n - **KQ2 — what explains the before-arm start rates: answered.** Adoption follows capability, not the aggregate. Claude starts 3 of 4 read-only doctor rows and 0 of 8 mutating create rows; opencode and dsh start 3 of 8 mutating rows; codex starts nothing. Devin produced the command's artifacts without reading its document, so a low start rate can hide delivery.\n-- **KQ3 — which discovery defects exist: answered.** One confirmed collision costs 12 commands on Claude (`32/44`), the same file is mirrored into OpenCode untested, the same command has three native spellings, and Devin has no command surface at all. No check measures any of it.\n+- **KQ3 — which discovery defects exist: answered.** One confirmed collision costs 12 commands on Claude (`32/44`), the same file is mirrored into OpenCode untested, the same command has three native spellings, and Devin has no command surface at all. No check measures any of it. (The strategy box stays unticked because the iteration record's text dropped the backticks around `skill.md`; the answer is in `iterations/iteration-003.md`.)\n - **KQ4 — what an external repository sees first: answered.** A confirmation step that skips its advisor and embedder legs when the daemon is cold, a first start whose cascade probe (2,500 ms) exceeds the hook child budget (2,200 ms), and a pre-existing hook config that silently wins the merge.\n - **KQ5 — measured cost and what stays invisible: answered.** 196.2 ms median / 352.4 ms p95 and 273 bytes per prompt; warm embed 6.57 ms; CLI 63 to 71 ms. The cost is recorded and aggregated but not surfaced by `advisor_status` or any setup leg, and no session total exists.\n \n ## 3. Findings\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/research.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"- **KQ3 — which discovery defects exist: answered.** One confirmed collision costs 12 commands on Claude (`32/44`), the same file is mirrored into OpenCode untested, the same command has three native spellings, and Devin has no command surface at all. No check measures any of it. (The strategy box stays unticked because the iteration record's text dropped the backticks around `skill.md`; the answer is in `iterations/iteration-003.md`.)\",\"oldString\":\"- **KQ3 — which discovery defects exist: answered.** One confirmed collision costs 12 commands on Claude (`32/44`), the same file is mirrored into OpenCode untested, the same command has three native spellings, and Devin has no command surface at all. No check measures any of it.\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/research.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794525306158,"end":1794525309966}}}}
