{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794525389226,"sessionID":"ses_e2e0e4b2cffeAWQl6ZGxUDL6xW","part":{"partID":"prt_1d20c5c7b001h5HaflOFsur0AK","sessionID":"ses_e2e0e4b2cffeAWQl6ZGxUDL6xW","messageID":"msg_1d20c3ab9001iSQptmIlDlOyiO","type":"tool","id":"call_af8cc27cdc3341a28b501cbb","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && d=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux && find $d/deep-research-ledger -type f | head -5; echo ===; grep -o '\"findingsCount\":[0-9]*' $d/deep-research-ledger/* 2>/dev/null | head -5; echo ===; sed -n '/OVERVIEW/,/ANCHOR:key-questions/p' $d/deep-research-dashboard.md | head -30"},"output":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/deep-research-ledger/frames/0000000000000001.frame\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/deep-research-ledger/frames/0000000000000003.frame\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/deep-research-ledger/frames/0000000000000007.frame\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/deep-research-ledger/frames/0000000000000005.frame\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/deep-research-ledger/frames/0000000000000002.frame\n===\n===\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\nReducer-generated observability surface for the active research packet.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:overview -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:status -->\n## 2. STATUS\n- Topic: Find further improvements to command surfacing after the planned phases 005 to 008: better UX for the person and the model (what the hook brief says, when a command is offered, asked or started, the install and setup path for an external repository), better performance (hook time, embedder cost, cold start, token cost of the brief) and above all usefulness across the six CLIs (claude, codex, opencode, pi, devin, dsh): whether a model on each runtime actually starts an offered command, and what stops it.\n- Started: 2026-11-12T22:53:18Z\n- Status: COMPLETE\n- Iteration: 5 of 5\n- Session ID: fanout-ux-1794523629654-v541y3\n- Parent Session: none\n- Lifecycle Mode: new\n- Generation: 1\n- continuedFromRun: none\n- stopReason: maxIterationsReached\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:status -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:progress -->\n## 3. PROGRESS\n\n| # | Focus | Track | Ratio | Findings | Status |\n|---|-------|-------|-------|----------|--------|\n| 1 | The model-visible brief: measured payload, withheld document path, unobservable offer, and the argued-route scoring defect | brief-contract | 0.90 | 5 | complete |\n| 2 | Before-arm runtime behaviour: the policy split behind each start rate, the path-versus-outcome gap, and the policy that stops at the command | cross-cli-behaviour | 0.88 | 4 | complete |\n| 3 | Per-runtime command discovery: the 12-command Claude loss, the three native spellings, and the missing visibility check | discovery-surface | 0.83 | 3 | complete |\n| 4 | First run in an external repository: the skipped cold advisor, the first-start budget inversion, the shadowed hook config, and the spelling correction | first-run | 0.88 | 4 | complete |\n| 5 | The cost ledger: measured brief and hook cost, the invisible part, and the missing session total | cost | 0.88 | 4 | complete |\n\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/deep-research-ledger/fram