pt; warm embed 6.57 ms; CLI 63 to 71 ms. The cost is recorded and aggregated but not surfaced by `advisor_status` or any setup leg, and no session total exists.\n \n ## 3. Findings\n \n-Nineteen findings across five iterations; `iterations/iteration-00N.md` carries the full evidence, and `deltas/iter-00N.jsonl` carries the structured rows. The unique ones, grouped:\n+Twenty findings across five iterations; `iterations/iteration-00N.md` carries the full evidence, and `deltas/iter-00N.jsonl` carries the structured rows. The fourth iteration's spelling correction is folded into item 13. The unique ones, grouped:\n \n ### 3.1 The brief\n \n 1. The brief is three lines of 242 to 298 bytes; 233 bytes of it is the static comment-hygiene directive, so 78 to 96 percent of a short brief is prompt-independent. [SOURCE: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/render.ts:162]\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/research.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\":\"Twenty findings across five iterations; `iterations/iteration-00N.md` carries the full evidence, and `deltas/iter-00N.jsonl` carries the structured rows. The fourth iteration's spelling correction is folded into item 13. The unique ones, grouped:\",\"oldString\":\"Nineteen findings across five iterations; `iterations/iteration-00N.md` carries the full evidence, and `deltas/iter-00N.jsonl` carries the structured rows. The unique ones, grouped:\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/ux/research.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794525398433,"end":1794525399552}}}}
